  "/incumbent/diagnostics/3": "string:Urban programme: composition=compound -> Single/FP-RECT (source/site fallback outside preferred family); main floors=[1,1] -> 1 (within preferred range); body footprint target=90.30m2 actual=25.28m2; target advisory, no declared budget adapter; frontage is a placement preference; continuity and party-wall wishes are not certified; native boundary rights unchanged.",
